/// One row per agent version (SCD type 2). Grain = Agent_BK, StartDate. Also known as: Broker, Intermediary, Adviser. Guidance: Pick the version whose StartDate and EndDate cover the date you are asking about. For today, filter IsCurrent = 1.
table DimAgent
	lineageTag: 6e63ce7d-61d4-5f78-97d5-913efc812888
	sourceLineageTag: [distribution].[DimAgent]

